306 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In Grand Rapids Public Schools, we envision a Multi-Tiered System of Supports that ensures every scholar receives the academic, behavioral, and social emotional support needed to thrive. Through data-driven practices, tiered supports, and collaborative partnerships, we commit to fostering environments where all students are empowered to achieve their fullest potential and become self-directed, productive members of society.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
