413 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Utilizing several measures - including rubrics, interviews, and walkthroughs, along with other coordinated data sources \(such as suspensions and minor behaviors\), the TFI provides guidance into which schools may be selected for induction into future MTSS Cohorts. A score of 70% or above on the TFI indicates that a tier of support is in place, alongside with regular data reviews - a score below 70% on a particular tier of support would indicate that school would benefit from professional learning around that MTSS component. )
/E (Utilizing several measures - including rubrics, interviews, and walkthroughs, along with other coordinated data sources \(such as suspensions and minor behaviors\), the TFI provides guidance into which schools may be selected for induction into future MTSS Cohorts. A score of 70% or above on the TFI indicates that a tier of support is in place, alongside with regular data reviews - a score below 70% on a particular tier of support would indicate that school would benefit from professional learning around that MTSS component. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
